INTERPRETATION:
  If PHENIX shows NOTABLY LOWER reduction than REFMAC/CNS/other,
  that is consistent with the CDL-restraint confound (PHENIX
  structures may already be closer to conformation-dependent
  equilibria before MechLib runs). If reduction is SIMILAR across
  all software categories, that argues against the restraint
  library being the primary driver of the observed effect.
  Remember: PHENIX usage does not guarantee CDL restraints were
  actually active for any given structure -- this is a proxy,
  not a definitive test. See script docstring for caveats.
